  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "'## [14.0.0-prerelease.1](https://github.com/dotnet/dotnet-operator-sdk/compare/v13.3.7-prerelease.2...v14.0.0-prerelease.1) (2026-11-11)\n\n### ⚠ BREAKING CHANGES\n\n* **client:** remove JsonPatch.Net and the synchronous client API (#1319)\n* **web:** replace LocalTunnel with external webhook endpoints (#1301)\n* **core:** add .NET 11 support and drop .NET 8 and .NET 9 (#1285)\n\n### Features\n\n* **core:** add .NET 11 support and drop .NET 8 and .NET 9 ([#1285](https://github.com/dotnet/dotnet-operator-sdk/issues/1285)) ([cf148f9](https://github.com/dotnet/dotnet-operator-sdk/commit/cf148f93278bbae937596511776e9d8d80ac538a)), closes [#if](https://github.com/dotnet/dotnet-operator-sdk/issues/if) [#1303](https://github.com/dotnet/dotnet-operator-sdk/issues/1303) [#1301](https://github.com/dotnet/dotnet-operator-sdk/issues/1301) [#1319](https://github.com/dotnet/dotnet-operator-sdk/issues/1319) [#1319](https://github.com/dotnet/dotnet-operator-sdk/issues/1319) [#1323](https://github.com/dotnet/dotnet-operator-sdk/issues/1323) [#1319](https://github.com/dotnet/dotnet-operator-sdk/issues/1319)\n* **web:** replace LocalTunnel with external webhook endpoints ([#1301](https://github.com/dotnet/dotnet-operator-sdk/issues/1301)) ([8cb1f82](https://github.com/dotnet/dotnet-operator-sdk/commit/8cb1f827b88faaa69fe17b5d0e73b68a4b1cc741)), closes [#1300](https://github.com/dotnet/dotnet-operator-sdk/issues/1300) [#1303](https://github.com/dotnet/dotnet-operator-sdk/issues/1303) [#1285](https://github.com/dotnet/dotnet-operator-sdk/issues/1285) [#1319](https://github.com/dotnet/dotnet-operator-sdk/issues/1319) [#1285](https://github.com/dotnet/dotnet-operator-sdk/issues/1285) [#1319](https://github.com/dotnet/dotnet-operator-sdk/issues/1319) [#1319](https://github.com/dotnet/dotnet-operator-sdk/issues/1319)\n\n### Code Refactoring\n\n* **client:** remove JsonPatch.Net and the synchronous client API ([#1319](https://github.com/dotnet/dotnet-operator-sdk/issues/1319)) ([b974485](https://github.com/dotnet/dotnet-operator-sdk/commit/b974485bf5eb55f847cd5ce0f54c81455c569c12)), closes [#1318](https://github.com/dotnet/dotnet-operator-sdk/issues/1318) [#1303](https://github.com/dotnet/dotnet-operator-sdk/issues/1303) [#1285](https://github.com/dotnet/dotnet-operator-sdk/issues/1285) [#1301](https://github.com/dotnet/dotnet-operator-sdk/issues/1301) [#1032](https://github.com/dotnet/dotnet-operator-sdk/issues/1032)\n'",
